Every case means several documents – any
of them can differ by one character.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,350
One typo in the model – and the
settlement goes back for fixes.

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:18,100
RenovaCheck cross-checks them –
before the authority does.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,300
Upload the files – it reads addresses,
amounts, models, dates and signatures.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:29,600
Discrepancies appear at once –
with severity, reason and rule.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,800
Every finding points to the
exact spot on the document page.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,700
A person makes the call – with a comment
and a full who-and-when history.

9
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,800
Then a control report – PDF or
CSV, ready for the case file.

10
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,400
Less manual cross-checking.
More time for your clients.

11
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:56,000
RenovaCheck. Consistent
documents, peace of mind.
